---
title: Caesar cipher
tags: tools
---
{% from "macros/tool.njk" import toolSection with context %}
{% from "macros/tool-frame.njk" import toolFrame %}
{% set filename = page.fileSlug %}
{% set intro %}
<p class="px-2">
    A very simple method of encryption, the Caesar cipher - also known as a shift cipher - 'shifts' the alphabet a certain number of spaces, pushing the letters at the end to the beginning.
    The most common Caesar cipher is Rot 13, where 
    <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">A</code> 
    becomes 
    <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">N</code> 
    and so forth. You can optionally add a key to the cipher to further encrypt your results, this will create a custom alphabet to rotate through &ndash;
     see the <a href="/ciphers/substitution" class="text-convrtr">Substitution Cipher</a> below for more information.
</p>
<p class="px-2">
     There is more information available on the <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caesar_cipher" class="text-convrtr">Caesar_cipher</a> Wikipedia page. 
</p>
{% endset %}
{% call toolSection(intro) %}
{% call toolFrame(filename, "Caesar cipher", placeholder = "Example: Hello → 5 [shift] → Mjqqt") %}
<div class="input-group w-auto">
    <label class="input-group-text" for="{{ filename }}Key"><span class="visually-hidden">Caesar cipher </span>Key</label>
    <input type="text" class="form-control caesar-key" id="{{ filename }}Key" placeholder="Optional" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="{{ filename }}Status">
</div>
{#- One shift at a time: previous and next apply the new shift straight away, as Shift does #}
<div class="input-group w-auto">
    <label class="input-group-text" for="{{ filename }}Shift">Shift</label>
    <button class="btn btn-outline-convrtr" type="button" id="{{ filename }}Prev" aria-label="Previous shift"><i class="bi bi-chevron-left" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
    <input type="number" class="form-control caesar-shift" id="{{ filename }}Shift" min="1" max="25" value="3" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="{{ filename }}Map {{ filename }}Status">
    <button class="btn btn-outline-convrtr" type="button" id="{{ filename }}Next" aria-label="Next shift"><i class="bi bi-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
    <button class="btn btn-convrtr" type="button" id="{{ filename }}Run">Shift</button>
</div>
<span class="caesar-map" id="{{ filename }}Map"></span>
{% endcall %}
{% endcall %}
